WEBVTT

00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:06.270
A pigeon that carried friendship.

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:16.846
Instead of being taken away to Mexico, Candy was
suddenly adopted by the wealthy Adley family.

00:00:17.698 --> 00:00:22.729
It was the beginning of a hectic
change for her.

00:00:54.981 --> 00:00:56.456
Slept well!

00:00:56.491 --> 00:00:57.718
You're awake?

00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:00.292
Good morning!

00:01:01.266 --> 00:01:02.266
Dorothy!

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:05.398
Uh, and what is this place?

00:01:05.433 --> 00:01:05.922
Huh?

00:01:05.952 --> 00:01:13.517
I've been riding in the carriage for so long;
every time I'd wake up, I was at a different place.

00:01:14.594 --> 00:01:20.750
You don't need to worry anymore! Miss Candy is
now an Adley daughter, no matter what anyone says!

00:01:21.109 --> 00:01:23.479
Come on, stop with this "miss Candy" thing...

00:01:23.679 --> 00:01:27.039
Haven't we promised each other
that we'd remain friends?

00:01:27.452 --> 00:01:31.934
I wanted to call you "miss Candy" ever
since the time you came here.

00:01:32.594 --> 00:01:33.714
Dorothy...

00:01:34.554 --> 00:01:38.137
I think I would be happier that way.

00:01:38.422 --> 00:01:40.330
But... when the two of us are alone...

00:01:40.473 --> 00:01:43.521
Yes... but it would be a problem if someone
saw me stopping to think...

00:01:43.522 --> 00:01:46.496
...what kind of addressing should I use when
speaking to you.

00:01:46.497 --> 00:01:48.557
I don't like this "miss Candy" thing.

00:01:49.398 --> 00:01:52.111
Don't do that!
You mustn't undress by yourself!

00:01:53.373 --> 00:01:55.451
I'm not a baby anymore!

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.380
Ladies of the high class don't
change by themselves!

00:02:02.559 --> 00:02:03.740
Oh, boy.

00:02:04.311 --> 00:02:06.974
I'm almost like a kissekae doll now!

00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:12.278
After breakfast, go the butler's
room exactly at 8:25.

00:02:14.328 --> 00:02:15.740
At 8:25?

00:02:17.739 --> 00:02:21.824
At 8:30, please go to madam Elroy's room.

00:02:22.279 --> 00:02:23.861
I was called only to hear that?

00:02:23.896 --> 00:02:24.450
Yes.

00:02:27.555 --> 00:02:28.748
This is so stupid.

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:32.962
Why couldn't they tell me to go to aunt
Elroy's room right from the beginning?

00:02:33.536 --> 00:02:35.976
Rich people have way too much time
on their hands!

00:02:36.557 --> 00:02:39.538
Uh, aunt Elroy's room was...

00:02:40.189 --> 00:02:42.321
It wasn't here, wasn't it?

00:02:45.138 --> 00:02:49.270
I wanted to see you exactly in 8:30.

00:02:49.282 --> 00:02:53.048
Forgive me. I lost my way
inside the house...

00:02:53.343 --> 00:02:57.909
From now till 11:55, you'll
be studying this. All of it.

00:02:58.851 --> 00:03:00.047
What is it?

00:03:00.526 --> 00:03:03.822
A register of the Adley family.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:08.020
You need to memorize everyone's
genealogy and names in one day.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.792
-Memorize all of this?!
-That's right.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:22.956
I guess that rich people
obsess over dumb things...

00:03:23.365 --> 00:03:26.271
That's right! I wonder if Anthony
and the others are in here as well.

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:32.308
There he is!
But I like the real one better!

00:03:33.742 --> 00:03:35.023
Stear and Archie are here, as well!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:39.999
Miss, please start from the
first page.

00:03:40.377 --> 00:03:41.178
Yeah.

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:44.605
Don't do that.

00:03:46.756 --> 00:03:48.934
She's still in there!

00:03:49.126 --> 00:03:52.460
We'll save her with my new invention!

00:03:57.839 --> 00:03:59.501
An earthquake!

00:04:00.183 --> 00:04:01.367
Oh no!

00:04:01.617 --> 00:04:04.081
It's dangerous, the ceiling could collapse!

00:04:06.771 --> 00:04:08.608
Candy! This way!

00:04:14.889 --> 00:04:18.089
What do you think? It's a
self-oscillating generator I invented!

00:04:18.402 --> 00:04:21.066
It wasn't a real earthquake!

00:04:21.157 --> 00:04:22.223
Miss Candy!

00:04:22.758 --> 00:04:23.686
Candy...!

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:30.403
We got out all right!

00:04:31.493 --> 00:04:34.522
Aunt Elroy is out and she won't
be back before evening!

00:04:34.557 --> 00:04:36.079
We're free to do anything, Candy!

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.327
Where is Anthony?

00:04:38.728 --> 00:04:40.040
He's on a date.

00:04:40.075 --> 00:04:41.077
Date?

00:04:41.628 --> 00:04:43.690
He went horse-riding with Eliza.

00:04:44.257 --> 00:04:46.563
Anthony went with Eliza?

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:53.155
Anthony, what's the matter?
Hurry up!

00:04:54.245 --> 00:04:56.624
Eliza, is it far from here?

00:04:56.659 --> 00:04:58.340
We should be there soon!

00:05:00.227 --> 00:05:03.235
But we've been riding for
two hours already.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:08.063
Anthony, you don't need to
worry so much about your roses!

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.617
Eliza, you haven't told me the truth?

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:13.628
Who knows.

00:05:17.927 --> 00:05:23.490
So you lied when you said that you
know of a new rose garden around here?

00:05:24.202 --> 00:05:25.603
I'm sorry!

00:05:26.996 --> 00:05:27.669
Eliza!

00:05:28.086 --> 00:05:31.161
I just wanted to ride with you, Anthony.

00:05:31.735 --> 00:05:33.619
And that's why you lied to me?

00:05:33.753 --> 00:05:35.175
Don't get me wrong!

00:05:35.578 --> 00:05:36.808
Eliza, you're...

00:05:37.019 --> 00:05:38.872
Huh, you're upset?

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.327
I'm going back!

00:05:40.555 --> 00:05:41.845
Wait, Anthony!

00:05:42.499 --> 00:05:46.601
If Candy were the one to invite you for a ride...
You wouldn't be mad if she lied to you?

00:05:46.636 --> 00:05:49.567
Candy is not a kind of
person to tell lies!

00:05:53.339 --> 00:05:54.269
Watch out, Eliza!

00:05:55.956 --> 00:05:57.956
Stop the horse, Eliza!

00:06:09.882 --> 00:06:11.505
Eliza, you're going right at them!

00:06:22.178 --> 00:06:25.034
-Eliza!
-Stop, stop!

00:06:28.897 --> 00:06:30.325
Hang in there, Eliza!

00:06:30.524 --> 00:06:32.360
It hurts... I thought that I'd die.

00:06:32.489 --> 00:06:34.287
Hang on to me.

00:06:36.501 --> 00:06:40.193
You appeared right in front of me,
where the hell were you looking?

00:06:40.361 --> 00:06:42.632
We're sorry.
Now, let's go.

00:06:42.755 --> 00:06:45.007
Wait!
Are you running away?

00:06:45.213 --> 00:06:49.087
We're not! I want to get
her to the doctor quickly.

00:06:49.165 --> 00:06:51.305
Yeah and who's gonna
pick up all of those?

00:06:51.905 --> 00:06:52.963
What is your name?

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.529
I'm Tom from the Steve farm!

00:06:55.922 --> 00:06:57.944
I'm Anthony of the Adley family.

00:06:58.085 --> 00:06:59.949
-See you then!
-Hey! Wait!

00:07:11.145 --> 00:07:15.130
Stewart, I heard that Anthony
and Eliza were hurt.

00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:17.812
Only miss Eliza was hurt.

00:07:18.836 --> 00:07:21.094
What? He must have punched her finally.

00:07:21.988 --> 00:07:24.215
And how is she feeling now?

00:07:24.322 --> 00:07:24.905
Don't know...

00:07:25.455 --> 00:07:26.792
Go away, Candy!

00:07:27.547 --> 00:07:28.603
Neil!

00:07:29.907 --> 00:07:34.352
You're rude, Neil!
We came to see her because we were worried!

00:07:34.723 --> 00:07:38.002
She doesn't want to see
anybody but Anthony!

00:07:38.037 --> 00:07:39.887
Anthony is in there, right?

00:07:40.087 --> 00:07:42.409
Yeah. Right next to Eliza.

00:07:43.628 --> 00:07:47.372
-Anthony...
-It still hurts you, Eliza?

00:07:47.407 --> 00:07:48.992
Hurts like I'm going to die...

00:07:49.599 --> 00:07:52.615
But doctor couldn't find
anything wrong with you...

00:07:53.028 --> 00:07:55.047
You'd trust that quack?

00:07:55.614 --> 00:07:58.253
Anthony, take my hand.

00:08:02.214 --> 00:08:04.184
You take my pain away
when you do this...

00:08:12.434 --> 00:08:16.788
I think Eliza is pretending to be hurt
so she could be alone with Anthony.

00:08:17.702 --> 00:08:19.453
Poor Anthony!

00:08:19.859 --> 00:08:22.313
I wonder if Eliza was hurt badly...

00:08:23.038 --> 00:08:25.776
Candy, you don't have to worry about her!

00:08:26.166 --> 00:08:27.083
But...

00:08:27.186 --> 00:08:29.523
-You can't go in there!
-What's going on?

00:08:29.559 --> 00:08:32.957
Hey! Where is Anthony!
I want to see Anthony!

00:08:32.958 --> 00:08:34.065
Please calm down!

00:08:34.507 --> 00:08:36.759
Mr. Anthony will come to see you.

00:08:37.572 --> 00:08:38.842
I wonder about that!

00:08:39.008 --> 00:08:41.320
What business do you have
with mr. Anthony?

00:08:41.472 --> 00:08:43.806
Just a man-to-man talk!

00:08:44.356 --> 00:08:46.903
Tom!
Tom, it's you!

00:08:47.104 --> 00:08:47.898
Candy!

00:08:49.454 --> 00:08:50.864
Candy!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.528
What's the matter, Tom?

00:08:52.906 --> 00:08:55.800
You, too! What are you
doing in this place!

00:08:56.377 --> 00:09:00.668
I don't really know why or how,
but I got adopted into Adley family!

00:09:00.955 --> 00:09:03.693
Adley?
Then, this...

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:08.219
Alright then!
This Anthony guy lives here, right?

00:09:08.254 --> 00:09:10.440
Yeah! But he's not in here
right now!

00:09:10.634 --> 00:09:12.197
He ran away, after all!

00:09:12.565 --> 00:09:16.301
I don't know what this is all about,
but Anthony doesn't just run away from things.

00:09:16.336 --> 00:09:21.627
He goes after every skirt, but when a real man
confronts him, he just flees!

00:09:22.851 --> 00:09:26.626
Anthony doesn't usually
chase women around...

00:09:27.124 --> 00:09:31.946
Shut up! He was chasing a woman when
she almost crashed into my carriage!

00:09:31.947 --> 00:09:33.824
I swerved off the road
and made a huge mess!

00:09:34.377 --> 00:09:35.240
You're lying!

00:09:35.837 --> 00:09:36.712
Candy!

00:09:37.436 --> 00:09:40.859
You're wrong!
Anthony would never do such a thing!

00:09:41.262 --> 00:09:45.157
Candy... are you saying
that I'm the one who is lying?

00:09:45.382 --> 00:09:49.000
You know that I've never told lies!

00:09:49.397 --> 00:09:51.017
I'm not saying that...

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:55.838
Now that you've become a rich lady,
you don't even want to talk to me anymore?

00:09:56.264 --> 00:09:57.086
Tom...

00:10:03.307 --> 00:10:04.061
Madam!

00:10:04.986 --> 00:10:06.842
Who is this filthy looking kid?

00:10:07.262 --> 00:10:08.304
Actually...

00:10:11.657 --> 00:10:13.693
-Pay him and get him out of here.
-I understand.

00:10:13.728 --> 00:10:17.070
Money? I didn't come here for money!

00:10:17.105 --> 00:10:21.708
Anyway, get this eyesore out of here.
This is an Adley' entrance!

00:10:21.874 --> 00:10:22.684
I understand.

00:10:24.424 --> 00:10:25.864
What are you doing?
Let go of me!

00:10:26.514 --> 00:10:28.225
-Don't do anything to him!
-Candy!

00:10:29.653 --> 00:10:33.554
Candy, you've become one of them
as soon as stuffed you with money!

00:10:34.489 --> 00:10:35.370
Tom!

00:10:38.811 --> 00:10:41.639
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Hey Candy, Honey and Meg just called,
they want their BGMs back.

00:10:57.350 --> 00:11:00.760
Now that you've become a rich lady,
you don't even want to talk to me anymore?

00:11:03.038 --> 00:11:06.103
That's not true! I'm still me!

00:11:08.346 --> 00:11:13.233
But why did Tom refuse to listen to me?

00:11:15.872 --> 00:11:20.014
I've come to trust him during
the ten years I lived with him.

00:11:21.311 --> 00:11:25.642
I also believe what Anthony said.

00:11:38.926 --> 00:11:41.286
I wonder who is that...
So late at night.

00:11:49.226 --> 00:11:50.161
Anthony?

00:11:56.722 --> 00:11:59.270
-Anthony!
-Hello, Candy!

00:11:59.572 --> 00:12:00.641
How is Eliza?

00:12:01.261 --> 00:12:04.040
She's okay. I finally managed
to get out.

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:05.065
I see.

00:12:05.683 --> 00:12:08.965
By the way, there is something
I'd like to speak to you about.

00:12:09.168 --> 00:12:12.311
Miss Candy! Don't leave your
room dressed like that!

00:12:12.437 --> 00:12:14.805
I just came to speak to Anthony...

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:18.534
Please return to your room!
Or they will scold me again.

00:12:18.915 --> 00:12:19.927
Dorothy.

00:12:19.928 --> 00:12:20.685
Candy!

00:12:21.257 --> 00:12:23.426
We'll talk in the morning.

00:12:26.664 --> 00:12:30.828
Please call me whenever you want
to put on your gown!

00:12:31.181 --> 00:12:33.269
Even for something like that?

00:12:33.409 --> 00:12:35.082
That is my job.

00:12:36.101 --> 00:12:39.936
Dorothy, I like doing my own
things by myself.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:43.010
If you do that, I will be fired!

00:12:45.863 --> 00:12:49.586
Oh, boy. It seems that I'm free
only when I'm sleeping.

00:12:50.021 --> 00:12:52.741
Should you have a nightmare,
please call me.

00:12:53.571 --> 00:12:55.988
What? I'm not even free to dream?

00:13:17.286 --> 00:13:19.594
Good morning.
What is that thing?

00:13:19.807 --> 00:13:22.410
It's his new invention,
self-moving excercise machine!

00:13:22.527 --> 00:13:24.828
What do you think?
Want to try it out?

00:13:25.044 --> 00:13:26.896
By the way, where is Anthony?

00:13:26.931 --> 00:13:30.776
-Haven't seen him since this morning.
-Maybe went to Eliza's place?

00:13:31.125 --> 00:13:35.070
He keeps coming home so late.
Maybe...?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.888
Hey, Candy!

00:13:43.377 --> 00:13:45.003
A...Archie, stop this thing!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.197
Anthony!

00:14:05.616 --> 00:14:08.349
Good morning!
I've been waiting you for two hours already.

00:14:08.415 --> 00:14:09.711
Do you have any business with me?

00:14:10.731 --> 00:14:14.533
Of course, I wanted to apologize to you.
I'm really sorry.

00:14:15.525 --> 00:14:18.242
To hear something like that from a rich person.

00:14:19.277 --> 00:14:21.275
I'm really sorry for what happened yesterday.

00:14:21.432 --> 00:14:22.315
Really.

00:14:24.252 --> 00:14:27.668
And that's why I waited for you here.

00:14:29.729 --> 00:14:32.257
I'll show you what I think about this.

00:14:38.855 --> 00:14:40.321
What are you doing?

00:14:40.738 --> 00:14:42.691
This is our cowboys' way of doing.

00:14:43.246 --> 00:14:46.117
I see. It's a slightly painful
way of greeting someone.

00:14:46.746 --> 00:14:49.046
By the way, you want me to
greet you back?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:50.571
You can try.

00:14:50.663 --> 00:14:51.863
Is it really okay?

00:14:52.314 --> 00:14:55.838
Someone stuck-up like you could never
feel this otherwise.

00:14:56.263 --> 00:14:58.287
Forgive my words then!

00:15:02.631 --> 00:15:06.332
-It hurts...
-Are you okay, Tom?

00:15:10.921 --> 00:15:12.599
Anthony!

00:15:16.985 --> 00:15:17.941
They went this way!

00:15:27.775 --> 00:15:29.635
-Anthony!
-Tom!

00:15:52.222 --> 00:15:54.005
I... I give up.

00:15:56.636 --> 00:15:59.810
Me too.
I'm done for!

00:16:01.831 --> 00:16:03.465
What's up with you two?

00:16:03.504 --> 00:16:05.992
We're sorting out matters like men.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:08.827
Yeah, a problem between two friends.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.946
What happened here?

00:16:16.349 --> 00:16:20.188
Candy, Anthony isn't the kind
of person who runs away.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:24.102
Candy, now there is finally someone
who is both your and my friend.

00:16:26.542 --> 00:16:28.691
Tom, Anthony!

00:16:33.831 --> 00:16:34.951
Tasty!

00:16:35.554 --> 00:16:36.754
It's great!

00:16:36.912 --> 00:16:38.420
It's from one of my cows.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.479
Are you okay, Tom?

00:16:42.073 --> 00:16:43.532
What, this?

00:16:45.501 --> 00:16:49.467
Candy, let's help him take
this milk to the town.

00:16:49.555 --> 00:16:52.413
-Great!
-I can do it alone!

00:16:52.449 --> 00:16:57.538
-Tom, we are your friends!
-Yup, friends.

00:17:09.154 --> 00:17:10.027
Here.

00:17:19.257 --> 00:17:22.343
That's... mr. Anthony of the Adley family!

00:17:29.468 --> 00:17:33.359
How could you do such a thing?
Have you no shame?

00:17:33.394 --> 00:17:35.867
I don't think it was something
to be ashamed of!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:42.172
Anthony, have you forgotten that
you are the pride of the Adley family?

00:17:42.207 --> 00:17:43.134
I haven't!

00:17:43.578 --> 00:17:47.438
But... Adleys don't go around
carrying milk!

00:17:47.623 --> 00:17:49.969
I was just helping out a friend!

00:17:50.332 --> 00:17:53.408
A friend? That filthy cowboy
is your friend?

00:17:54.414 --> 00:17:57.949
Tom is something like a brother to me.

00:17:58.161 --> 00:18:03.342
Candy, your social status has changed.
Forget about the old days.

00:18:03.571 --> 00:18:07.444
My status has changed; does that mean that
I'm supposed to change friends as well?

00:18:07.654 --> 00:18:11.783
Of course! Pick friends who are
more suitable for an Adley!

00:18:12.058 --> 00:18:15.019
Aunt, your ideas are all wrong!
Friends are not something you own!

00:18:15.138 --> 00:18:19.254
It's easy to abandon friends, but you
can't just replace them with some new ones!

00:18:19.464 --> 00:18:23.829
Anthony! Are you talking back to me?!

00:18:24.058 --> 00:18:26.298
I'm just speaking the truth!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.598
What.. what words!

00:18:30.278 --> 00:18:32.753
Candy, all of this is your fault.

00:18:32.924 --> 00:18:37.903
Ever since you came to this house, Anthony
and the others became completely insolent!

00:18:38.069 --> 00:18:40.017
Our eyes were opened!

00:18:41.267 --> 00:18:45.670
That was the first time in my life
I've beat up someone.

00:18:47.927 --> 00:18:49.506
Fighting somebody...

00:18:52.032 --> 00:18:54.281
...and being so exhausted...

00:18:54.597 --> 00:18:56.638
You're speaking like a savage!

00:18:56.673 --> 00:18:59.640
Anthony, I'm ordering you now.

00:18:59.858 --> 00:19:04.419
I will separate you from Candy for a while.
You will live in a forrest mansion.

00:19:04.454 --> 00:19:05.763
Aunt?

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:12.722
Candy, you are forbidden to meet Tom.
Moreover, you must not leave the estate!

00:19:15.913 --> 00:19:20.789
A few days have passed since
Anthony parted from her.

00:19:27.337 --> 00:19:31.058
With Anthony gone,
even roses are feeling lonely.

00:19:32.267 --> 00:19:34.594
-Miss Candy.
-Dorothy?

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:40.860
Does becoming a rich lady mean
that I'm supposed to be alone?

00:19:41.643 --> 00:19:43.853
...that I'm supposed to be
imprisoned in here?

00:19:44.841 --> 00:19:48.078
I hate it. I want to go back
to Pony's home.

00:19:48.405 --> 00:19:49.530
I don't care about being poor.

00:19:49.532 --> 00:19:53.184
I want to see people whom I like.
I want to fight with my friends.

00:19:53.185 --> 00:19:55.528
I want to live a life where
I'm allowed to laugh freely.

00:20:00.733 --> 00:20:01.553
A pigeon.

00:20:03.618 --> 00:20:05.044
It brought a message!

00:20:06.356 --> 00:20:07.174
Come here!

00:20:13.996 --> 00:20:15.506
It's from Anthony!

00:20:17.223 --> 00:20:18.650
Candy, how are you?

00:20:19.466 --> 00:20:22.096
Tom trained this carrier pigeon.

00:20:23.324 --> 00:20:25.030
I'm not discouraged yet!

00:20:26.131 --> 00:20:31.371
Living with Tom taught me there isn't
anything in this world I can't do.

00:20:32.295 --> 00:20:36.901
I might be far from you, but I can
still send you these messages.

00:20:38.354 --> 00:20:40.003
Don't give up yet.

00:20:41.234 --> 00:20:43.816
If something unpleasant happens,
it's always easy to run.

00:20:44.588 --> 00:20:47.636
I'm doing my best for the
Adley family.

00:20:48.253 --> 00:20:52.065
Candy, let's do our best together.
For happiness.

00:20:55.804 --> 00:20:58.521
Anthony, I won't give up!

00:21:03.782 --> 00:21:07.714
A new hope appeared in Candy's heart.

00:21:08.584 --> 00:21:15.524
It was because a single pigeon brought her
new courage from inside the deep forrest.

00:21:15.811 --> 00:21:20.105
To be continued.
